{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102425","id":2315862290,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6KCUES","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102425","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102425.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102425.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102425","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102425/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102425/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102425/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/375e7bb686903f97eefe00f3c46296195f317124","number":102425,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for white parameter to AgX tonemapper (Mk. 2)","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes #101558\r\n- Fixes #102416\r\n\r\nNot cherry-pickable to 4.3, as AgX is only in 4.4.\r\n\r\nAlso limits white parameter from being set lower than 0.01 in the editor.\r\n\r\n### Draft State\r\nI am intentionally leaving this PR in a draft state because I expect that the performance characteristics are not be suitable for merging this into Godot. Additionally, documentation must be further updated in this PR if it was to be merged.\r\n\r\n### Usage\r\nIn addition to resolving issues with using AgX with the Mobile renderer, the white parameter can be used to give higher contrast by decreasing `white`. This approach is higher quality than using the Environment's contrast adjustment and does not significantly affect the brightness of the scene like the [previous incorrect approach.](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101559)\r\n\r\n| 16.0 white (Forward+) | 2.0 white (Forward+)\r\n| --- | ---\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3673cb5f-f9cd-4bbe-ab3d-e939257c1ea7) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1b10c74-5022-46e2-980b-00b33c776110)\r\n\r\n#### Consistent rendering between Mobile and Forward+\r\nBecause the Mobile renderer only provides values to the tonemapper up to `2.0`, you can achieve a similar appearance with AgX between the Mobile and Forward+ renderers by setting the `white` paramter to `2.0` or less. This makes it easier to use AgX on a cross-platform game that must use the Mobile renderer on some platforms, but uses the Forward+ renderer on others.\r\n\r\n### Limitations\r\nThe `white` parameter does not function below values of `1.172`, so this parameter is clipped to this minimum in `EnvironmentStorage`.\r\n\r\n### Performance\r\nUsing the visual profiler, [Calinou's tonemapping test scene](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87260), ~4K window, and an NVIDIA 980 Ti on Windows 11, I recorded the following performance stats:\r\n\r\n**AgX (this PR): 1.35 ms**\r\nTony McMapface: 1.29 ms\r\n[AgX (exact, hardcoded white)](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102435): 1.22 ms\r\nAgX (Godot 4.4 beta 2): 1.19 ms\r\nACES: 1.07 ms\r\nFilmic: 1.0 ms\r\nRienhard: 0.93 ms\r\nLinear: 0.82 ms","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-02-04T18:18:08Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T12:13:01Z","closed_at":"2025-05-29T20:45:32Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"allenwp:agx-add-white-param-mk2","ref":"agx-add-white-param-mk2","repo":{"id":515179976,"node_id":"R_kgDOHrUFyA","name":"godot","full_name":"allenwp/godot","owner":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","even